abstract: >-
  Open-source glacier-segmentation benchmark and decision-oriented cryosphere
  research baseline for Kazakhstan. It combines Sentinel-2, Sentinel-1 and
  terrain inputs with leakage-resistant temporal evaluation, hard metrics,
  area error, provenance, explicit label-quality tiers and fail-closed
  scientific claim gates. API and dashboard interfaces expose the validated
  artifacts while keeping forecasts and hazard outputs exploratory.
